        <mxCell id="n95" value="BLOCKER

The profiles run on one host.
nxtseo is installed on another:
not on PATH, not importable,
no repo. The profile cannot
call nxtseo today." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1590" y="862" width="240" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
