        <mxCell id="n99" value="being replaced" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1750" y="40" width="110" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n100" value="STATUS

The loop closed for the first time on 2026-09-06:
indexing actions executed against a live property,
grading window opens 15 days later.

Not yet built: an agent between next and act for
content, and a git-backed copy adapter that edits
real source files rather than a sidecar.

BLOCKER: the agent profiles and the engine are installed
on different hosts. The profile cannot call the engine
until that is resolved." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b0b0b0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1000" width="1140" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
